// Grounded Brain: life of an HTTP request (middleware order in src/app.ts)
// Eraser "Flow Chart" diagram-as-code
title Life of an HTTP request
direction down
colorMode bold

Incoming request [shape: oval, icon: monitor, color: gray]
requestLogger [icon: file-text, label: "requestLogger (pino-http)\nX-Request-Id, logs on finish"]
corsMiddleware [icon: shield, label: "corsMiddleware\nonly CLIENT_URL, with credentials"]
apiRateLimiter [icon: clock, label: "apiRateLimiter on /api\n300 req / 15 min per IP"]
Auth route [shape: diamond, label: "/api/auth/* ?"]
Better Auth [icon: lock, color: green, label: "Better Auth handler\n(reads raw body itself)"]
bodyParsers [icon: code, label: "bodyParsers\nJSON + urlencoded, 2 MB"]
Route [shape: diamond, label: "route"]
Inngest handler [icon: zap, color: purple, label: "/api/inngest\nInngest serve handler (signed)"]
Health [icon: heart, label: "/health router (public)"]
requireAuth [icon: lock, color: green, label: "requireAuth\nsession → req.session"]
Feature limiter [icon: clock, label: "aiRateLimiter / ingestionRateLimiter"]
Controller [icon: settings, label: "asyncHandler(controller)"]
Service [icon: layers, label: "service → repository"]
Response [shape: oval, icon: check-circle, color: green, label: "APIResponse.Ok / Created / NoContent"]
notFoundHandler [icon: x-circle, color: red, label: "notFoundHandler → 404"]
errorHandler [icon: alert-triangle, color: red, label: "errorHandler\n→ standard error envelope"]

Incoming request > requestLogger > corsMiddleware > apiRateLimiter > Auth route
Auth route > Better Auth: yes
Auth route > bodyParsers: no
bodyParsers > Route
Route > Inngest handler: /api/inngest
Route > Health: /health
Route > requireAuth: /api/workspaces/**, /api/memory
Route > notFoundHandler: no match
requireAuth > Feature limiter > Controller > Service > Response
Controller --> errorHandler: throws
notFoundHandler --> errorHandler
